<title>USA: Ernst Home to be delisted from Nasdaq.</title>
<headline>Ernst Home to be delisted from Nasdaq.</headline>
<dateline>SEATTLE 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ernst Home Center Inc said the Nasdaq Stock Market would no longer list the company's stock.</p>
<p>The company said in a statement late on Thursday that the exchange had denied Ernst's request to be listed despite filing for Chapter 11 bankruptcy in July.</p>
<p>&quot;Ernst intends to cooperate with market makers in its stock to pursue the possibility of maintaining quotations on the automated OTC Bulletin Board&quot; maintained by the National Association of Securities Dealers, the statement said.</p>
<p>-- New York newsroom, (212) 859-1610</p>
